{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12890","headline":"送刘评事赴广州使幕 · 韩翃","name":"送刘评事赴广州使幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征南官属似君稀，才子当今刘孝威。\n蛮府参军趋传舍，交州刺史拜行衣。\n前临瘴海无人过，却望衡阳少雁飞。\n爲报苍梧云影道，明年早送客帆归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}